">Explore Models</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"relative hidden lg:block\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-blue-600 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-30 transform translate-x-10 translate-y-10\"></div>\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/panel-ac-centrifugal-fan.webp\" alt=\"Panel AC Centrifugal Fan Unit\" class=\"relative rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-4 border-white/10 transform -rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition duration-500 w-full object-cover\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n            <!-- Mobile Image -->\n            <div class=\"lg:hidden mt-8\">\n                 <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/panel-ac-centrifugal-fan.webp\" alt=\"Panel AC Centrifugal Fan Unit\" class=\"rounded-xl shadow-lg border-2 border-white/20\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Why Choose Us -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 px-4\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n            <div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Why Choose Our Centrifugal Fans?</h2>\n                <div class=\"w-20 h-1 bg-blue-600 mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full\"></div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <!-- Card 1 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 card-shadow\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\">🚀</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">High-Pressure Cooling</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Moves air radially, delivering ideal cooling for enclosed panels with filtration.</p>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Card 2 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 card-shadow\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\">🛡️</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Reliable &#038; Robust</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Built for continuous, demanding operation in industrial environments.</p>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Card 3 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 card-shadow\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\">🤫</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Low Noise</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Optimized performance for sensitive electronic and industrial applications.</p>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Card 4 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 card-shadow\">\n                    <div class=\"text-4xl mb-4\">🎯</div>\n                    <h3 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\">Targeted Cooling</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed\">Utilizes an impeller to accelerate air for focused thermal management.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Types Section -->\n    <section id=\"types\" class=\"py-16 px-4 bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-t-[3rem] -mt-10 relative z-10\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n            \n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center mb-16\">\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Impeller Designs &#038; Service</h2>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-300 text-lg leading-relaxed\">\n                        Choosing the right impeller design is <span class=\"text-blue-400 font-bold\">essential</span> for optimal static pressure and airflow for your specific panel layout. Atlas Aircon offers expertise in all major types suited for industrial cooling.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Centrifugal-fan.webp\" alt=\"Industrial Centrifugal Fan Impeller\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-xl border border-slate-700 w-full object-cover h-64 md:h-80\" title=\"\">\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\">\n                <!-- Type 1 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-800/50 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-800 transition\">\n                    <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl mb-6\">\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-8 w-8\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 4v5h.582m15.356 2A8.001 8.001 0 004.582 9m0 0H9m11 11v-5h-.581m0 0a8.003 8.003 0 01-15.357-2m15.357 2H15\" /></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">🌀 Forward-Curved (FC)</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Compact design providing high air volume at lower speeds. Excellent for low-resistance applications and smaller Panel AC units.</p>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Small Scale Panels</span>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Type 2 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-800/50 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-800 transition\">\n                    <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl mb-6\">\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-8 w-8\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M14.752 11.168l-3.197-2.132A1 1 0 0010 9.87v4.263a1 1 0 001.555.832l3.197-2.132a1 1 0 000-1.664z\" /><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\" /></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">🔄 Backward-Curved (BC)</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Most efficient with self-limiting horsepower. Ideal for high-pressure systems with complex ducting or heavy filtration.</p>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Large Control Panels</span>\n                </div>\n                <!-- Type 3 -->\n                <div class=\"bg-slate-800/50 p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-800 transition\">\n                    <div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-blue-600/20 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center rounded-2xl mb-6\">\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-8 w-8\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M10.325 4.317c.426-1.756 2.924-1.756 3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 002.573 1.066c1.543-.94 3.31.826 2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 001.065 2.572c1.756.426 1.756 2.924 0 3.35a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.066 2.573c.94 1.543-.826 3.31-2.37 2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.572 1.065c-.426 1.756-2.924 1.756-3.35 0a1.724 1.724 0 00-2.573-1.066c-1.543.94-3.31-.826-2.37-2.37a1.724 1.724 0 00-1.065-2.572c-1.756-.426-1.756-2.924 0-3.35a1.724 1.724 0 001.066-2.573c-.94-1.543.826-3.31 2.37-2.37.996.608 2.296.07 2.572-1.065z\" /><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\" /></svg>\n                    </div>\n                    <h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold mb-3\">⚙️ Radial Blower</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4\">Robust design for high static pressure and harsh environments with dust or particulates. Extremely durable.</p>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-bold text-blue-500 uppercase tracking-widest\">Heavy Industrial Use</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Pricing Section -->\n    <section id=\"pricing\" class=\"py-20 px-4\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n            <div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900\">Price List</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-slate-500 mt-2\">Estimated market rates for Gujarat &#038; Western India</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse\">\n                    <thead>\n                        <tr class=\"bg-slate-50 text-slate-500 uppercase text-xs font-bold tracking-wider\">\n                            <th class=\"px-6 py-4\">Type &#038; Size</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-6 py-4\">Key Specification</th>\n                            <th class=\"px-6 py-4 text-right\">Approx. Price (INR)</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100\">\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition\">\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-800\">Forward-Curved (133mm)</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 text-slate-500 text-sm\">230V AC, Low Noise</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 text-right font-bold text-blue-600\">₹ 3,000 &#8211; ₹ 5,500</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition\">\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-800\">Backward-Curved (225mm)</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 text-slate-500 text-sm\">High Efficiency, EC Motor</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 text-right font-bold text-blue-600\">₹ 8,500 &#8211; ₹ 15,000</td>\n                        </tr>\n                        <tr class=\"hover:bg-blue-50/50 transition\">\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 font-semibold text-slate-800\">Radial Blower (Belt Drive)</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 text-slate-500 text-sm\">Heavy Duty Industrial</td>\n                            <td class=\"px-6 py-5 text-right font-bold text-blue-600\">₹ 12,000+</td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n                <div class=\"p-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-slate-200 text-xs text-center text-slate-500 italic\">\n                    *Prices depend on motor type (AC/EC), impeller material, and pressure rating. Contact us for a precise quote.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Repair & Maintenance -->\n    <section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-white border-y border-slate-200\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n            <div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16\">\n                <!-- Issues Focus -->\n                <div>\n                    <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold mb-8 flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-900\">\n                        <span class=\"text-amber-500\">⚠️</span> Common Repair Issues\n                    </h2>\n                    <div class=\"space-y-6\">\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-100\">\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-amber-600\">01</div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">Excessive Noise/Vibration</h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1\">Caused by unbalanced impellers, worn-out bearings, or loose hardware. Requires immediate attention.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-50 border border-slate-200\">\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-blue-600\">02</div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">Reduced Airflow</h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1\">Often due to dust buildup on blades, clogged filters, or incorrect belt tension in older units.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-4 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-red-50 border border-red-100\">\n                            <div class=\"font-bold text-red-600\">03</div>\n                            <div>\n                                <h4 class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">Motor Overheating</h4>\n                                <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1 text-red-900\">Indicative of electrical friction or seized bearings. This is a serious fire hazard.</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Do's and Don'ts -->\n                <div class=\"grid gap-6\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-emerald-50 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-emerald-100 shadow-sm\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-emerald-800 font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>\n                            Maintenance DO&#8217;s\n                        </h4>\n                        <ul class=\"text-sm space-y-3 text-emerald-900/80\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span>•</span> Clean impeller blades periodically for efficiency.</li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span>•</span> Check and lubricate bearings using recommended grease.</li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span>•</span> Tighten all mounting bolts to prevent vibration.</li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span>•</span> Monitor motor current and temperature regularly.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"bg-rose-50 p-6 rounded-3xl border border-rose-100 shadow-sm\">\n                        <h4 class=\"text-rose-800 font-bold mb-4 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zM8.707 7.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414L8.586 10l-1.293 1.293a1 1 0 101.414 1.414L10 11.414l1.293 1.293a1 1 0 001.414-1.414L11.414 10l1.293-1.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L10 8.586 8.707 7.293z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>\n                            Maintenance DON&#8217;Ts\n                        </h4>\n                        <ul class=\"text-sm space-y-3 text-rose-900/80\">\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 font-semibold text-rose-700\"><span>•</span> DON&#8217;T operate the fan if excessive vibration is noticed.</li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span>•</span> DON&#8217;T ignore grinding noises—it indicates bearing failure.</li>\n                            <li class=\"flex items-start gap-2\"><span>•</span> DON&#8217;T heavily restrict inlets; it damages the motor.</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Location & Service Areas -->\n    <section class=\"py-20 px-4 bg-slate-50\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\">\n            <div class=\"text-center mb-12\">\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 italic uppercase\">Centrifugal Fan Service Near Me?</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold mt-2\">Atlas Aircon is your trusted partner across Western India.</p>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"bg-white rounded-[2rem] p-8 md:p-12 shadow-inner border border-slate-200\">\n                <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-y-10 gap-x-6\">\n                    <div>\n                        <h5 class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2\">HQ / Central Region</h5>\n                        <ul class=\"text-slate-600 space-y-1\">\n                            <li class=\"font-bold text-slate-800\">Vadodara (Headquarters)</li>\n                            <li>Nadiad</li>\n                            <li>Anand</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h5 class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2\">North Gujarat</h5>\n                        <ul class=\"text-slate-600 space-y-1\">\n                            <li>Ahmedabad</li>\n                            <li>Mehsana</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h5 class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2\">South Gujarat</h5>\n                        <ul class=\"text-slate-600 space-y-1\">\n                            <li>Surat</li>\n                            <li>Vapi</li>\n                            <li>Valsad</li>\n                            <li>Daman</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div>\n                        <h5 class=\"font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4 border-b pb-2\">Industrial Corridor</h5>\n                        <ul class=\"text-slate-600 space-y-1\">\n                            <li>Bharuch</li>\n                            <li>Ankleshwar</li>\n                            <li>Dahej</li>\n                            <li>Jhagadia</li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                \n                <div class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-slate-100 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-6\">\n                    <div class=\"text-center md:text-left\">\n                        <p class=\"text-slate-400 text-sm\">Need urgent support?</p>\n                        <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900\">+91-97272-57141</p>\n                    </div>\n                    <a href=\"tel:+919727257141\" class=\"bg-blue-600 text-white px-10 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-blue-700 shadow-xl flex items-center gap-3 w-full md:w-auto justify-center\">\n                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z\" /></svg>\n                        Call Now\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- FAQ Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-20 px-4\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n            <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n                <!-- FAQ 1 -->\n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm open:shadow-md transition-all\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg list-none cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center text-slate-800\">\n                        Typical lifespan of a Centrifugal Fan?\n                        <span class=\"group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                        With proper maintenance (Do’s and Don’ts), a high-quality fan from Atlas Aircon can last 5 to 10 years. Regular inspection and lubrication are key factors in reaching this maximum lifespan.\n                    </p>\n                </details>\n                <!-- FAQ 2 -->\n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm open:shadow-md transition-all\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg list-none cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center text-slate-800\">\n                        How often should I service the fan?\n                        <span class=\"group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                        We recommend a comprehensive check every 6 to 12 months. This is crucial for maintaining low noise levels and preventing <span class=\"font-bold text-red-600 underline text-xs\">CRITICAL</span> downtime.\n                    </p>\n                </details>\n                <!-- FAQ 3 -->\n                <details class=\"group bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 p-6 shadow-sm open:shadow-md transition-all\">\n                    <summary class=\"font-bold text-lg list-none cursor-pointer flex justify-between items-center text-slate-800\">\n                        Centrifugal vs. Axial: Which is better for Panel AC?\n                        <span class=\"group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform\">▼</span>\n                    </summary>\n                    <p class=\"mt-4 text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n                        Centrifugal fans generate significantly higher static pressure. This is <span class=\"italic font-semibold\">essential</span> for moving air through filters, coils, and tight ducting (high resistance). Axial fans are better for open-space cooling but fail in high-resistance panel environments.\n                    </p>\n                </details>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Footer CTA -->\n    <footer class=\"bg-slate-900 text-white py-16 px-4\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto text-center\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">Explore our full range of industrial air movement solutions</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-slate-400 mb-8 italic\">Reliability | Performance | Expert Service</p>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 px-10 py-3 rounded-full font-bold transition inline-flex items-center gap-2\">\n                View General Centrifugal Fans\n                <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-5 w-5\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10.293 3.293a1 1 0 011.414 0l6 6a1 1 0 010 1.414l-6 6a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L14.586 11H3a1 1 0 110-2h11.586l-4.293-4.293a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\" /></svg>\n            </a>\n            \n            <div class=\"mt-16 pt-8 border-t border-slate-800 text-slate-500 text-sm flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4\">\n                <div>© 2024 Atlas Aircon Gujarat. All rights reserved.</div>\n                <div class=\"flex gap-6\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Privacy Policy</a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white\">Terms of Service</a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n</div>",
